  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth 4 Inclusion, Equality and Trust</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is strategically aligned with North Macedonia&#x2019;s Strategy for &#x201c;One Society for All,&#x201d;14approved by the Government in November 2019, which is the overarching strategic document on socialcohesion in the country, outlining a multi-sectoral policy aiming to advance tolerance, dialogue andcohesion between all communities, identities and cultures in the country. Furthermore, the projectactivities will be in line with the National Youth Strategy 2016-2025, prepared with UNDP support aswell as</narrative>
  </description>
